extends layout
block content
  .ui.container.rules-container
    .ui.text.container
      h1.ui.header.centered AI Competition Rules
    .ui.text.container
      p This competition is organized by:
      p.understated Max Planck Institute for Human Development
      p Lentzeallee 94
      p 14195 Berlin, Germany
    .ui.text.container
      h2.ui.header.centered Participation Rules
      p By joining the 
        span.emphasis AI competition queue 
        | and playing at least one game, you are automatically entered into the competition. The competition begins on 
        strong Start Date 
        | and ends on 
        strong End Date.
        | Outside of this time window, you will not be able to play games counting towards the competition.
    .ui.text.container
      h2.ui.header.centered Eligibility
      ul.ui.list
        li
          strong Age Restriction: 
          | The competition is open to individuals aged 18 years or older.
        li
          strong Employment Restriction: 
          | Employees of the Max Planck Society for Human Development are not eligible to win prizes.
        li
          strong Location Restriction: 
          | The competition is open to participants globally, except where prohibited by law. It is the participant's responsibility to ensure their participation complies with local laws and regulations.
    .ui.text.container
      h2.ui.header.centered Prizes
      p Prizes are paid out as 
        strong Amazon Vouchers.
        | To be able to receive a prize, you must live in a country where Amazon operates.
      p Participants are ranked on the Leaderboard based on the number of games they have won. Players that win more games will have a higher chance of winning a prize.
      p For the small contests, we distribute prizes according to the following scheme:
      ul.ui.list
        li 100€ Amazon voucher for a random top 10% participant.
        li 50€ Amazon voucher for a random top 20% participant.
        li 50€ Amazon voucher for a random top 35% participant.
        li 50€ Amazon voucher for a random top 50% participant.
      p For the big contest, we distribute prizes according to the following scheme:
      ul.ui.list
        li 500€ Amazon voucher for a random top 10% participant.
        li 150€ Amazon voucher for a random top 20% participant.
        li 150€ Amazon voucher for a random top 30% participant.
        li 150€ Amazon voucher for a random top 40% participant.
        li 150€ Amazon voucher for a random top 50% participant.
        li 150€ Amazon voucher for a random participant that won at least one game.
      p No double prizes. If a participant is drawn twice, one of the random draws is repeated.
    .ui.text.container
      h2.ui.header.centered Winner Selection and Notification
      p The winners will be selected according to our prize scheme and are drawn through a transparent random process that allows participants to verify that the winners were indeed drawn randomly. The winners will be publicly announced and will receive their Amazon voucher via email.
    .ui.text.container
      h2.ui.header.centered Disqualification
      p The following players will be disqualified:
      ul.ui.list
        li Players that do not comply with our terms of service
        li Players that violate any of our game rules
    .ui.text.container
      h2.ui.header.centered Early Termination and Changes
      p We reserve the right to terminate the competition prematurely or modify it during its course if it is not possible to guarantee proper execution for technical (e.g., errors in the AI) or legal reasons.
    .ui.text.container
      h2.ui.header.centered Privacy and Data Collection
      ul.ui.list
        li
          strong Username: 
          | Cookies are used to ensure username activation across sessions, but we do not track activity outside our website. Your username will be displayed on the leaderboard.
        li
          strong Email Addresses: 
          | Your email addresses will be stored to make sure that we can contact you to pay out prizes. We will not display your email address publicly or share it with a third party. We will delete all collected email addresses immediately after paying out the contest prizes.
        li
          strong Data Use: 
          | Refer to our Privacy Policy for details on data collection and usage.
      p By participating, participants acknowledge that their data, score, and game history will be used for prize distribution and public winner announcements.
